[music concourse]
The last rat bolts into a
hole behind the trunks,
trailing sparks.

The porter's hook is
heavier than it looks,
and fits your hand as if
it had been made for it.
A paper tag hangs from
the handle: UNCLAIMED.
Then, as you watch, the
word fades, and in the
same careful hand as the
Stationmaster's ledger,
your name writes itself
in its place.

[picture pic02]
The great hall. The board
clatters. The Buffer Stop
glows.

1. Read the departure
